OL,3,GNEWSAMen sentenced for damaging mosque
OL,4,Ain 'hate crime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been sentenced for
OL,7,Fdamaging a mosque in a racially or
OL,8,Freligiously motivated incident.
OL,10,FSeveral windows at Taunton Central
OL,11,FMosque in Tower Lane, Somerset, were
OL,12,Fsmashed on 6 September 2025 in what
OL,13,Fpolice described as a "hate crime".
OL,15,FAshley Oliver, 35, of Bulford in
OL,16,FWiltshire, and Alan Galloway, 35, of
OL,17,FEast Reach in Taunton, were found
OL,18,Fguilty of carrying out racially or
OL,19,Freligiously motivated criminal damage
OL,20,Fon the mosque.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
