OL,3,GNEWSAMen sentenced for damaging mosque
OL,4,Ain 'hate crime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair were fined #180 each at
OL,7,FTaunton Deane Magistrates' Court on
OL,8,FFriday and received restraining orders
OL,9,Fbanning them from being in the area
OL,10,Faround the mosque.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
